1. `void send(T message)`: This method should allow a thread to send a message of type `T` to the channel.
2. `T receive()`: This method should allow a thread to receive a message of type `T` from the channel. If no message is available, the method should block until a message is received.

You should also write a test case to verify the functionality of the `Channel` class using Google Test framework.

